# aeos-cli requires no environment variables for normal operation.
#
# Optional overrides:
#
# AEOS_GITLEAKS_PATH
#   Absolute path to the AEOS-pinned Gitleaks executable. Set this when
#   Gitleaks is installed somewhere outside PATH. When unset, AEOS resolves
#   `gitleaks` from PATH. If the executable cannot be found, AEOS reports
#   AEOS-SEC-010 and blocks rather than reporting a passing scan.
#
# AEOS_GITLEAKS_PATH=/usr/local/bin/gitleaks
#
# The following affect only the preview interface. The Go validator neither
# reads them nor behaves differently when they are set. See DEC-006.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#   Enables the conversation pane in the command interface. Read by
#   preview/serve.py at request time and never sent to the browser, written to
#   disk, or logged. Without it the interface falls back to the clipboard and
#   says so. Put the real value in .env, which is git-ignored — never here.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# AEOS_MODEL
#   Model used by the conversation pane. Defaults to claude-sonnet-4-6.
#
# AEOS_PREVIEW_PORT
#   Port for preview/serve.py. Defaults to 8000.
